The matrix is a list of 1, 2, 3, and 4.
The rows is 2.
The columns is 2.
The targetrows is 1.
The targetcolumns is 4.
The last is the last position of matrix.
The total is last plus 1.
If targetrows times targetcolumns is not total, set targetrows to rows, set targetcolumns to columns.

The line is empty text.
Place "[" into line.
For every spot from 0 to last.
If spot is more than 0 and spot modulo targetcolumns is 0, Place "," into line.
If spot modulo targetcolumns is 0, Place "[" into line.
The value is item spot of matrix.
Place format whole number value as text into line.
If spot modulo targetcolumns is less than targetcolumns minus 1, Place "," into line.
If spot modulo targetcolumns is targetcolumns minus 1, Place "]" into line.

Place "]" into line.
Show line.
